config BR2_PACKAGE_SMT_AUDIO_DSP
	bool "smt-audio-dsp"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_PLUGINS
	help
	  Custom LADSPA plugin (smt_hpf_limiter) for the SMT1019's 2 W
	  built-in speakers: a 4th-order Butterworth high-pass, a 3-band
	  voicing EQ (warmth/presence/air), and a makeup-gain tanh
	  soft-limiter.

	  The high-pass removes the low-frequency content the small drivers
	  over-excurse on, the EQ voices the boxy 40 mm drivers, and the
	  makeup gain + soft limiter raise music RMS toward the digital
	  ceiling for loudness without hard clipping.

	  Installs /usr/lib/ladspa/smt_audio_dsp.so, loaded by the ALSA
	  `type ladspa` PCM plugin (alsa-plugins) via /etc/asound.conf so
	  every audio stream is filtered transparently.
